A NOTE ON THE HARDWARE
The bill of materials references third-party components under their own terms.
Several are export-controlled in some jurisdictions, notably the thermal and
short-wave infrared imagers. The optional active-emission module involves
radioactive sources subject to national regulation. Nothing in this licence
grants permission to disregard any of that; see /safety.
